<title>PAKISTAN: Karachi 100-share index breaks 2,000-point barrier.</title>
<headline>Karachi 100-share index breaks 2,000-point barrier.</headline>
<dateline>KARACHI, Pakistan 1997-07-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Karachi Stock Exchange 100-share price index broke the 2,000-point psychological barrier as it rose 18.79 points, or 0.95 percent, to 2,000.60, some 40 minutes after the opening at 09.30 a.m. (0430 GMT), dealers said.</p>
